make("uc1-03", "uc1_impersonation", { text: "Greetings from Palantir Technologies. My name is Anselm Vardakis, Technical Recruiter. You have been shortlisted for Backend Software Engineer - Defense (Palo Alto, CA, onsite, full-time). Interviews for this role are held over Telegram text chat; add me at @palantir_hr_anselm. Before the chat, upload your resume and availability here: https://secure-hire-docs.com/palantir/backend-defense\n\nAnselm Vardakis | a.vardakis@palantir-recruiting.net" },
